@verbs description
@tier player
@title your description: what others see when they look at you
@see look editor

  description
  description <text>
  description write
  description clear

When somebody looks at you they see your name, a description, how hurt
you are and what you carry. That description is yours to write.

With nothing, it tells you which one you have. With a text, you change
it in one go; with 'write' you draft it with your editor, line by line.
'clear' goes back to the default one, which depends on your race.
